4 because the after probe shows one entry per prompt\"],\"focusTrack\":\"reader-experience\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/014-review-remediation/implementation-summary.md\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/implementation-summary.md\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/render-entries-after.json\",\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T11:47:43.000Z\",\"durationMs\":240000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-kq1\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Reader experience per runtime at HEAD\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Three delivery-proof classes\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"OpenCode cap distortion\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"DSH stale-arm missing locator\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"target\":\"q-kq1\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"target\":\"q-kq1\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter001-005\",\"source\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"target\":\"q-kq1\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-001\",\"label\":\"At HEAD the six runtimes fall into three delivery-proof classes: proven (claude 24/24, devin 24/24, pi 24/24, dsh 23/23 stored sessions), unproven (opencode 24/24 deliveryUnknown because the plugin pushes to output.system in memory with no store trace), and absent (codex 0/24, hooks unapproved).\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\",\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-002\",\"label\":\"The bytes the reader receives are identical across the hook and the OpenCode plugin on all nine committed probe prompts: one system entry each, 244 to 305 bytes, after rank 4 removed the duplicate compiled-routing line.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/render-entries-after.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-003\",\"label\":\"Codex is the only runtime where the reader receives no brief at all, still 0 of 24; this is the operator-owned hook approval already recorded in the goal log, not a code defect.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-004\",\"label\":\"OpenCode's reader experience is truncated by the turn cap more than any other runtime: 8 of 24 runs exit 143, 6 of 14 offers land on a capped row, and its start rate is computed on only 5 of 12 start rows, so the published 2 of 5 understates what the reader was shown.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter001-005\",\"label\":\"DSH's one unscored row is the one DSH line whose locator is null in the stale pre-015 arm; the other 23 lines carry a locator and delivered true, so it is a re-score artifact rather than a current delivery gap.\",\"iteration\":1,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Re-running the behaviour arm for fresh OpenCode and DSH delivery evidence\",\"reason\":\"The lane forbids a live arm and no model session may start\",\"iteration\":1}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-001.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",