",\\\"label\\\":\\\"OpenCode's reader experience is truncated by the turn cap more than any other runtime: 8 of 24 runs exit 143, 6 of 14 offers land on a capped row, and its start rate is computed on only 5 of 12 start rows, so the published 2 of 5 understates what the reader was shown.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter001-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"DSH's one unscored row is the one DSH line whose locator is null in the stale pre-015 arm; the other 23 lines carry a locator and delivered true, so it is a re-score artifact rather than a current delivery gap.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Re-running the behaviour arm for fresh OpenCode and DSH delivery evidence\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The lane forbids a live arm and no model session may start\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":1}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-001.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794570515677,"end":1794570527800}}}}
