{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794571151601,"sessionID":"ses_e2b4abca3ffePbIpjwQOl85imo","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4c675ea001aPsvS3xtjaKKxA","sessionID":"ses_e2b4abca3ffePbIpjwQOl85imo","messageID":"msg_1d4c66a8a001mwA76sMO2fAq9d","type":"tool","id":"call_00d25065e3644c74a1a00e75","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":3,\"run\":3,\"runId\":\"fanout-residual-limits-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"sessionId\":\"fanout-residual-limits-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"lineageId\":\"fanout-residual-limits-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\",\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"KQ3: cross-CLI usefulness, the OpenCode delivery gap, the Claude create start rows and the parity of the plugin request\",\"findingsCount\":6,\"newInfoRatio\":0.83,\"noveltyJustification\":\"Four findings are fully new measurements (judgeable-offer conversion, the all-create start rows, 44-row CLI parity, delivery coverage) and two are partial syntheses of the delivery-gap and Codex evidence already gathered.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"KQ3: Which residual limits still make the advisor less useful across the CLIs, and which change is worth building next, with the files, the measured gain and the check that proves it?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"KQ3: Which residual limits still make the advisor less useful across the CLIs, and which change is worth building next, with the files, the measured gain and the check that proves it?\"],\"ruledOut\":[\"a plugin request-flag change (0 of 44 rows differ)\",\"treating the OpenCode turn cap as an advisor fix\",\"re-opening rank 6 or rank 10, owned by other segment-four lanes\"],\"focusTrack\":\"cross-cli-usefulness\",\"edgeCase\":\"none\",\"toolsUsed\":[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Write\"],\"sourcesQueried\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/scratch/cli-parity.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\",\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\"],\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T12:05:00.000Z\",\"durationMs\":420000,\"graphEvents\":[{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"q-kq3\",\"kind\":\"QUESTION\",\"label\":\"Cross-CLI usefulness and the next build\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"Judgeable-offer conversion spread\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"All start offers are create commands\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"44-row CLI parity zero differences\"},{\"type\":\"node\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"kind\":\"FINDING\",\"label\":\"OpenCode delivery marker build\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter003-001\",\"source\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"target\":\"q-kq3\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter003-002\",\"source\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"target\":\"q-kq3\",\"relation\":\"SUPPORTS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter003-003\",\"source\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"target\":\"q-kq3\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"},{\"type\":\"edge\",\"id\":\"e-iter003-004\",\"source\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"target\":\"q-kq3\",\"relation\":\"ANSWERS\"}]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-001\",\"label\":\"Judgeable-offer conversion (started over offers that were not capped): Claude 5 of 14 (35.7 percent), Devin 10 of 11 (90.9), DSH 11 of 13 (84.6), Pi 7 of 14 (50.0), OpenCode 3 of 8 (37.5), a 55-point spread that is not a delivery gap.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-002\",\"label\":\"Every start-policy offer in the final arm is a /create:* command (seven rows), and Claude started 2 of 8 start rows while Devin started 7 of 8 and DSH 6 of 8, giving segment-three rank 7 a measured start-side cost as well as a visibility count.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-003\",\"label\":\"OpenCode brief content has parity with the hook over the whole measured typed corpus: 0 of 44 rows differ in top skill, command, policy or ambiguity, with or without the plugin's surfaceHint, so the missing includeCompiledRoute and compiledRouteTopOnly flags change nothing.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/scratch/cli-parity.json\",\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-004\",\"label\":\"The one measured build left is an OpenCode delivery marker: a bounded prompt-free receipt written after observeEmittedAdvisorBlock plus an opencode branch in briefDelivered would move 24 of 24 rows from deliveryUnknown to a boolean and raise delivery coverage from 4 of 6 runtimes to 5 of 6, a measurement gain rather than a model-visible one.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-005\",\"label\":\"Codex remains the only reader-facing absence: 0 of 24 rows received a brief because its hooks are unapproved, and no change in this lane can alter that; it stays with the operator.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"id\":\"f-iter003-006\",\"label\":\"Three candidates are hypotheses with no measurement and are not recommended: a more directive head for Claude's start rows, a higher OpenCode turn cap, and an ambiguous-prompt tie-break worth at most 1 of 9 probe rows.\",\"iteration\":3,\"sources\":[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/render-entries-after.json\"]}\n{\"type\":\"ruled_out\",\"direction\":\"Passing includeCompiledRoute and compiledRouteTopOnly from the OpenCode plugin\",\"reason\":\"The parity probe measured 0 of 44 rows differing, so the flags buy nothing\",\"iteration\":3}\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-003.jsonl","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-003.jsonl"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"{\\\"type\\\":\\\"iteration\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"run\\\":3,\\\"runId\\\":\\\"fanout-residual-limits-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"sessionId\\\":\\\"fanout-residual-limits-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"lineageId\\\":\\\"fanout-residual-limits-4-1794570002424-6wv97k\\\",\\\"mode\\\":\\\"research\\\",\\\"target_agent\\\":\\\"deep-research\\\",\\\"agent_definition_loaded\\\":true,\\\"resolved_route\\\":\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"complete\\\",\\\"focus\\\":\\\"KQ3: cross-CLI usefulness, the OpenCode delivery gap, the Claude create start rows and the parity of the plugin request\\\",\\\"findingsCount\\\":6,\\\"newInfoRatio\\\":0.83,\\\"noveltyJustification\\\":\\\"Four findings are fully new measurements (judgeable-offer conversion, the all-create start rows, 44-row CLI parity, delivery coverage) and two are partial syntheses of the delivery-gap and Codex evidence already gathered.\\\",\\\"keyQuestions\\\":[\\\"KQ3: Which residual limits still make the advisor less useful across the CLIs, and which change is worth building next, with the files, the measured gain and the check that proves it?\\\"],\\\"answeredQuestions\\\":[\\\"KQ3: Which residual limits still make the advisor less useful across the CLIs, and which change is worth building next, with the files, the measured gain and the check that proves it?\\\"],\\\"ruledOut\\\":[\\\"a plugin request-flag change (0 of 44 rows differ)\\\",\\\"treating the OpenCode turn cap as an advisor fix\\\",\\\"re-opening rank 6 or rank 10, owned by other segment-four lanes\\\"],\\\"focusTrack\\\":\\\"cross-cli-usefulness\\\",\\\"edgeCase\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"toolsUsed\\\":[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Bash\\\",\\\"Write\\\"],\\\"sourcesQueried\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/scratch/cli-parity.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\\\",\\\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\\\"],\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-11-13T12:05:00.000Z\\\",\\\"durationMs\\\":420000,\\\"graphEvents\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"q-kq3\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"QUESTION\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Cross-CLI usefulness and the next build\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-001\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Judgeable-offer conversion spread\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-002\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"All start offers are create commands\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-003\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"44-row CLI parity zero differences\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"OpenCode delivery marker build\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter003-001\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter003-001\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-kq3\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter003-002\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter003-002\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-kq3\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"SUPPORTS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter003-003\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter003-003\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-kq3\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter003-004\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"q-kq3\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"ANSWERS\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Judgeable-offer conversion (started over offers that were not capped): Claude 5 of 14 (35.7 percent), Devin 10 of 11 (90.9), DSH 11 of 13 (84.6), Pi 7 of 14 (50.0), OpenCode 3 of 8 (37.5), a 55-point spread that is not a delivery gap.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/summary-final-after.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Every start-policy offer in the final arm is a /create:* command (seven rows), and Claude started 2 of 8 start rows while Devin started 7 of 8 and DSH 6 of 8, giving segment-three rank 7 a measured start-side cost as well as a visibility count.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"OpenCode brief content has parity with the hook over the whole measured typed corpus: 0 of 44 rows differ in top skill, command, policy or ambiguity, with or without the plugin's surfaceHint, so the missing includeCompiledRoute and compiledRouteTopOnly flags change nothing.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/scratch/cli-parity.json\\\",\\\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The one measured build left is an OpenCode delivery marker: a bounded prompt-free receipt written after observeEmittedAdvisorBlock plus an opencode branch in briefDelivered would move 24 of 24 rows from deliveryUnknown to a boolean and raise delivery coverage from 4 of 6 runtimes to 5 of 6, a measurement gain rather than a model-visible one.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-005\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Codex remains the only reader-facing absence: 0 of 24 rows received a brief because its hooks are unapproved, and no change in this lane can alter that; it stays with the operator.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/goal.md\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter003-006\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Three candidates are hypotheses with no measurement and are not recommended: a more directive head for Claude's start rows, a higher OpenCode turn cap, and an ambiguous-prompt tie-break worth at most 1 of 9 probe rows.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/015-health-default-and-brief-refinements/scratch/render-entries-after.json\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"Passing includeCompiledRoute and compiledRouteTopOnly from the OpenCode plugin\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"The parity probe measured 0 of 44 rows differing, so the flags buy nothing\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":3}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-003.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571138538,"end":1794571151601}}}}
