no injected-context row\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"node\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-002\\\",\\\"kind\\\":\\\"FINDING\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Advisor text is assistant output in 10 of 24\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter004-001\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter004-001\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"SUPPORTS\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"edge\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"e-iter004-002\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"f-iter004-002\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"f-iter003-004\\\",\\\"relation\\\":\\\"SUPPORTS\\\"}]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-001\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"All 24 OpenCode arena sessions are present in the store and their 562 message rows are 513 assistant, 24 idle, 24 user and 1 synthetic, with no injected-context or system row type, so the store keeps every session but no record of what the plugin injected.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-002\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Ten of 24 sessions contain Advisor: and every hit is in an assistant row, so a store-based delivery check would report 10 of 24 delivered and 14 missing while counting model output as delivery evidence.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"~/.local/share/opencode/opencode.db\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-003\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The build is a new prompt-free write rather than a new reader: the plugin writes a bounded receipt (session id, block hash, runtime, epoch) after observeEmittedAdvisorBlock and briefDelivered gains an opencode branch that reads the receipt, never the session text.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\".opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"finding\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"f-iter004-004\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"The receipt key space is proven: all 24 OpenCode run lines carry a sessionId and projectDir, and SPECKIT_ is already in the behaviour runner child-environment allowlist, so a SPECKIT_ metrics path reaches the plugin without an allowlist change.\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4,\\\"sources\\\":[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-final.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\\\"]}\\n{\\\"type\\\":\\\"ruled_out\\\",\\\"direction\\\":\\\"A reader-only delivery fix against the OpenCode session store\\\",\\\"reason\\\":\\\"10 of 24 sessions would read as delivered on assistant text, so the check would be wrong on 14 rows and would treat model output as evidence\\\",\\\"iteration\\\":4}\\n\",\"path\":\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/residual-limits-4/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\"}"},"time":{"start":1794571481042,"end":1794571489371}}}}
